    "name": "CARD RACER",
    "steam_appid": 2658020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0a0140baed6b3de232f3b7ebb853ca92.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>With a dynamic choice of weapons, including rockets, protective shields, and electrifying lightning, you'll have a strategic toolbox at your disposal to create thrilling races. Whether you're attacking opponents or safeguarding your lead, these weapons add an electrifying layer of excitement to every lap.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/833a5ce62a39aa79d757322f784cfd96.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Winning goes beyond speed alone; it's about employing a customizable set of cards to alter the race dynamics. The card system allows for extensive customization, allowing players to fine-tune their kart's performance and disrupt rivals.. Whether it's enhancing speed, sabotaging opponents cards, or stealing their weapons, the strategic possibilities are limitless. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/4def361c96a63931320af5752d6ac17b.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Race with a diverse cast of characters, each possessing unique skills. Unlock their character-specific comic books through exciting challenges, submerging yourself in rich backstories and thrilling adventures for a truly immersive experience.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0a0140baed6b3de232f3b7ebb853ca92.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/0b954d253532ad0082731657204de934.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>With a dynamic choice of weapons, including rockets, protective shields, and electrifying lightning, you'll have a strategic toolbox at your disposal to create thrilling races. Whether you're attacking opponents or safeguarding your lead, these weapons add an electrifying layer of excitement to every lap.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/833a5ce62a39aa79d757322f784cfd96.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/d51a16a6a01e4839c248da92f8a26a98.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Winning goes beyond speed alone; it's about employing a customizable set of cards to alter the race dynamics. The card system allows for extensive customization, allowing players to fine-tune their kart's performance and disrupt rivals.. Whether it's enhancing speed, sabotaging opponents cards, or stealing their weapons, the strategic possibilities are limitless. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/4def361c96a63931320af5752d6ac17b.avif?t=1737996832\" width=616 height=82 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.poster.avif?t=1737996832\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.webm?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658020/extras/2c3fd6accbdc315b63631c0f2471b6d8.mp4?t=1737996832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Race with a diverse cast of characters, each possessing unique skills. Unlock their character-specific comic books through exciting challenges, submerging yourself in rich backstories and thrilling adventures for a truly immersive experience.</strong>",
